/* 数值取自设计稿「储罐设置-下拉框储罐类型13」「-物料颜色14」PNG：面板 278 宽、右缘距屏幕 55、圆角约 16；
   药丸 202×57、行距 77；色块 64×57、行距 87、圆角 4、两列。 */
.sp-mask {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.sp-panel {
  position: absolute;
  right: 55rpx;
  width: 278rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
}

.sp-panel-pills {
  padding: 32rpx 0 18rpx 37rpx;
}

.sp-panel-swatches {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 33rpx 46rpx 3rpx;
}

.sp-pill {
  width: 202rpx;
  height: 57rpx;
  line-height: 57rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  color: #131313;
  background-color: #f5f6f8;
  border-radius: 29rpx;
}

.sp-pill-on {
  color: #ffffff;
  background-color: #0066a2;
}

.sp-swatch {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 64rpx;
  height: 57rpx;
  margin-bottom: 30rpx;
  border-radius: 4rpx;
}

/* 设计稿没有画选中态；用深色描边标出当前颜色 */
.sp-swatch-on {
  border: 4rpx solid #131313;
}
